    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, enu aIsarela; lelu himukuzambuka Yodana mwiŋili nakuhetanyuza yayibadika nikutoha ninovu, ninyikala yamaneni yikweti mpwembu jakwata nimwiwulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niantu amaneni ataluka, wowu anyana kaAnaki iweluka, lwatiya kuyitena nawu, Watweshaŋa kwimana nawanyana kaAnaki hinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilukaku dinu lelu, neyi, Yehova Nzambi yeyi diyi wukutwamina ŋaku kuwukuyeyi neyi kesi kanoŋeshaŋa; wakayijilumuna, wakayizeyesha kuwukuyeyi; nineyi hiwakayitemunamu, hiwakayijilu munachaswayi hohu, mwomwanahoshiyi Yehova naneyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakela neyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi nayitemunumu dehi kuwukuyeyi, bayi wakahosha mumuchima weyi neyi, Yehova naŋiŋiji nakaheti ituŋidinakuloŋa kwamuku; komana muloŋa wakutama kwanyuzoyu diwu wanayi temwiniyi Yehova kuwukuyeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwukwijila nakuheta ituŋa dawu, hiwukwijila nanochu chiwaloŋa, indi kwiji nanochu chiwoloka muchimaku, ilaŋa nanochu chatama nyuzoyu dichi chakuyite mwinayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi kuwukuyeyi, kulonda akakoleshi izu dasanyikililiyi Yehova ankakululajeyi, Abarahama, naIsaka, naYakoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi ilukaku neyi, Yehova Nzambi yeyi hadi nakukwinka ituŋididadiwahi nindi wudiheti nanochu chiwalonaku; muloŋa enu mumuzawachinchika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anukaku, bayi wakavulamena chiwamuvulokeli Yehova Nzambi yeyi azuwi muna mwisaŋaku; kufumisha kwifuku diwafumini mwituŋa daEjipitu, ninichi chimwashikili kunu, mwadikaŋili naYehova hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela kuHorebi mwamuvulokeli Yehova azuwi, Yehova wazuwilinanenu nindi ayijilumuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinakandukili mpidi nakutambula malola awubasa, wowu malola awubasa achitiyaŋenu chatiyaŋeniyi Yehova nanenu, nashakamini hampidi mafuku makumi awana nimwaana niwufuku; hinadiiliyakudya, hela kunwa mejuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wanyinkeli malola awubasa ayedi akusoneka namunu waNzambi; asonekeluhu mwaya mazu ejima ahosheliyi Yehova nanenu hampidi, izu dindi difumaŋa mukesi ifuku dakupompa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chelili mafuku makumi awana nimwaana niwufuku anamani dehi, Yehova hakunyinka malola awubasa ayedi, wowu malola awubasa achitiyaŋenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakuŋila nindi, Nyamukaku, wufumi kunuwukunkumuki swayi; muloŋa antu eyi iwafumishili muEjipitu anaditamishi dehi; anafumi dehi swayi munjila yinayilejeli; aneli dehi mukishi wawu wakusuŋununa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakuŋila henahana, nindi, Iwu muza nawumoni dehi komana himuza wachinchika; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nleki kwami niyijilumuni, nŋimi ijina dawu difumi munu mwishina dewulu; eyi nikwili muza wakuyibadika wena niŋovu nikutoha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nochu nabalumukili nakunkumukili mpidi, mpidi yidi nakubidimakesi; nimalola awubasa achitiyaŋenu ayedi adi mumakasami ayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naminitali, hinukumona komana munamuvulumuni dehi Yehova Nzambi yenu; munadilili dehi mwana kaŋombi wakusuŋununa; munafumi dehi swayimunjila yayilejeliyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakwatili malola awubasa ayedi, nayinatili mumakasami ayedi nayifumpili kumesu enu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadinatili chamesu hamaseki kumesu aYehova mafuku makumi awana nimwaana niwufuku, neyi chinelili hakusambila; hinadiili yakudya hela kunwa mejuku; muloŋa wanshidi yenu yimwavulumwini, chimwelili chatama kumesu aYehova, himukumuvuloka azuwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami natiyili woma wakuzuwa nikutatashana kwayizuwililiyi nachu Yehova, nindi ayijilumuni. Ilaŋa Yehova kwindi wantiyililili henohu nawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova waswejeli kuzuwa naAroni, nindi amujilumuni; namulombeleli Aroni henohu nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nanoneni nshidi yenu, yowu mwanakaŋombi imwelili, namwocheli mukesi, namutwili, namuchikili, wahehelineyi lunkuŋu hohu; nakuwili lunkuŋu lwindi mukakaloŋa kafumini hampidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NikuTabera, nikuMasa, nikuKibiroti Hatava mwamuzuwishili Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chayitemesheliyi Yehova nindi mufumi kuKadeshi Baraneya, wayililinindi, Yenu mwakaheti ituŋa dinayinki; himukudikaŋa nezu daYehova Nzambi yenu, himwamwitiyili hela kutiyilila mwizu dinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumisha kwifuku dinayiilukili mwadikaŋa naYehova hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
